!Reference Parameter File for Processing of Docking Poses in SDF
!Comment out by !
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RMSD             1.0            !Remove redundant poses within a RMSD threshold

!H-Bonding to the protein or pocket filling by SMARTS-defined structural motif
!SMARTS dist x y z      !within a distance of a protein atom or position (Cartesian coordinates x,y,z)
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[O,n&X2]         2.6     15.920   5.552  12.530 !Acceptor to the hinge
![O,n,N;H,H2,H3] 3.6     0       0       0      !Donor
[a]              3       7.765   1.203  13.027  !aromatic in the back-site

!Allowed dihedrals
!Line starts with Dihedral | SMARTS defined torsion | allowed range from -180 to 180 degrees
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!Dihedral [!#1][$([SR0](=O)=O)][a][a] 50 130 -130 -50                      !sulfonylaryl
!Dihedral [C,N;X4][CX4R0;H1,H2][a][c] 50 130 -130 -50                      !allylic strain
!Dihedral [!#1][C,N;X4R0][C,N;X4][!#1] 30 90 150 180 -90 -30 -180 -150     !sp3-sp3 strain

!LeDock specific paramters
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Score              -7.0
!xLE                 0.5
WithinTopScore       0.0
!VDW               -30.0
!Strain             12.0
!HBond              -6.0
!Elec                .0
!IntraClash        12.0
!Torsion           12.0

!Clustering by maximum common substruture ranging from 0 to 1 being identical
!Could take very long for more than 1000 compounds of big size
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!ClusterByMCS 0.8               
